<article id="actual-12-15"><h2>don_list_add <small>[12.15]</small></h2><p><code>string don_list_add(string list, string value, string glue)</code></p><p>don-master-ash-lib/scripts/don_master_lib.ash:148–152</p><p>function_actual12.15.2</p><pre><code>string don_list_add(string list, string value, string glue) {
