}</code></pre></article>
<article id="actual-12-16"><h2>don_list_add <small>[12.16]</small></h2><p><code>string don_list_add(string list, string value)</code></p><p>don-master-ash-lib/scripts/don_master_lib.ash:154–156</p><p>function_actual12.16.2</p><pre><code>string don_list_add(string list, string value) {
