<article id="actual-12-17"><h2>don_list_remove <small>[12.17]</small></h2><p><code>string don_list_remove(string list, string value, string glue)</code></p><p>don-master-ash-lib/scripts/don_master_lib.ash:158–166</p><p>function_actual12.17.2</p><pre><code>string don_list_remove(string list, string value, string glue) {
    string[int] bits = split_string(list, glue);
    string out = &quot;&quot;;
    foreach i, bit in bits {
        if (bit == value || bit == &quot;&quot;) continue;
        out = don_list_add(out, bit, glue);
    }
    return out;
}</code></pre></article>
