<article id="actual-12-20"><h2>don_pref_exists_or_daily <small>[12.20]</small></h2><p><code>boolean don_pref_exists_or_daily(string property)</code></p><p>don-master-ash-lib/scripts/don_master_lib.ash:180–184</p><p>function_actual12.20.2</p><pre><code>boolean don_pref_exists_or_daily(string property) {
    if (property == &quot;&quot;) return false;
    if (starts_with(property, &quot;_&quot;)) return true;
    return property_exists(property);
}</code></pre></article>
<article id="actual-12-21"><h2>don_pref_string <small>[12.21]</small></h2><p><code>string don_pref_string(string property)</code></p><p>don-master-ash-lib/scripts/don_master_lib.ash:186–192</p><p>function_actual12.21.2</p><pre><code>string don_pref_string(string property) {
    if (!don_pref_exists_or_daily(property)) {
        don_warning(&quot;Unknown preference: &quot; + property);
        return &quot;&quot;;
    }
    return get_property(property);
}</code></pre></article>
