<article id="actual-12-74"><h2>don_require <small>[12.74]</small></h2><p><code>boolean don_require(boolean condition, string message)</code></p><p>don-master-ash-lib/scripts/don_master_lib.ash:643–647</p><p>function_actual12.74.2</p><pre><code>boolean don_require(boolean condition, string message) {
